    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rogue Drifter</strong> is a rogue-lite car combat game that fuses the high-octane thrill of drifting with looter-shooter mechanics and survivors-like gameplay. Set in a 1990s early-stage apocalypse, you\u2019ll face relentless hordes of mutants and cyborgs while customizing and upgrading your combat rig over the course of each run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644130/extras/7feaecd894be4b4fcdbc2767b21ae10f.avif?t=1753413243\" data-has-big width=800 height=233 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You start in a rundown garage with nothing but a beat-up ride and a burning need to escape. But this isn\u2019t just survival\u2014it\u2019s style. Drift through procedurally generated biomes, collect XP, boost your kinetic battery, and unleash a chaotic arsenal of weapons that grow stronger with every encounter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644130/extras/78db73d98b80463070576d1bdc8f2246.avif?t=1753413243\" data-has-big width=800 height=319 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Drift-Based Combat</strong> \u2013 Movement <i>is</i> your weapon. Gain shields, build energy, and trigger abilities by stylishly drifting through enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Your Rig</strong> \u2013 Unlock and combine an arsenal of weapons and passives to create unique, overpowered loadouts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rogue-lite Replayability</strong> \u2013 Procedurally generated encounters and meta-progression systems keep each run fresh.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kinetic Battery System</strong> \u2013 Drifting charges your kinetic core, powering all your offensive and defensive capabilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Loot, Upgrade, Survive</strong> \u2013 Defeat bosses, earn supply crates, and evolve your rig over time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose Your Path</strong> \u2013 Pick your route, take on GPS encounters, and make decisions that shape each session.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644130/extras/2f42b29d8e3e65150e477f32b20ebf8e.avif?t=1753413243\" data-has-big width=800 height=233 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hit the gas, light up your boost, and dive into the chaos. In <i>Rogue Drifter</i>, it\u2019s not just about surviving the apocalypse\u2014it\u2019s about <i>owning it</i>.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rogue Drifter</strong> is a rogue-lite car combat game that fuses the high-octane thrill of drifting with looter-shooter mechanics and survivors-like gameplay. Set in a 1990s early-stage apocalypse, you\u2019ll face relentless hordes of mutants and cyborgs while customizing and upgrading your combat rig over the course of each run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644130/extras/7feaecd894be4b4fcdbc2767b21ae10f.avif?t=1753413243\" data-has-big width=800 height=233 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You start in a rundown garage with nothing but a beat-up ride and a burning need to escape. But this isn\u2019t just survival\u2014it\u2019s style. Drift through procedurally generated biomes, collect XP, boost your kinetic battery, and unleash a chaotic arsenal of weapons that grow stronger with every encounter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644130/extras/78db73d98b80463070576d1bdc8f2246.avif?t=1753413243\" data-has-big width=800 height=319 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Drift-Based Combat</strong> \u2013 Movement <i>is</i> your weapon. Gain shields, build energy, and trigger abilities by stylishly drifting through enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Your Rig</strong> \u2013 Unlock and combine an arsenal of weapons and passives to create unique, overpowered loadouts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rogue-lite Replayability</strong> \u2013 Procedurally generated encounters and meta-progression systems keep each run fresh.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kinetic Battery System</strong> \u2013 Drifting charges your kinetic core, powering all your offensive and defensive capabilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Loot, Upgrade, Survive</strong> \u2013 Defeat bosses, earn supply crates, and evolve your rig over time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose Your Path</strong> \u2013 Pick your route, take on GPS encounters, and make decisions that shape each session.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644130/extras/2f42b29d8e3e65150e477f32b20ebf8e.avif?t=1753413243\" data-has-big width=800 height=233 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hit the gas, light up your boost, and dive into the chaos. In <i>Rogue Drifter</i>, it\u2019s not just about surviving the apocalypse\u2014it\u2019s about <i>owning it</i>.</p>",
